  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"70753ad0-5191-42b2-bbdd-7b4c679c1d4a\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\n<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p>VI Nails offers the best press-on nails in Canada, celebrating individuality and self-expression with high-quality, handmade designs for every occasion.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n<p>VI Nails provides a variety of press-on nails made from durable materials. Each set includes various sizes, adhesive tabs, and glue. Our collection features designs ranging from classic to bold, suitable for weddings, parties, and daily wear.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Handmade Excellence:</strong> Unique, superior quality handcrafted nails.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Quick Application:</strong> Flawless manicure in just 10 minutes.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Reusable and Long-Lasting:</strong> Durable, reusable designs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p>We accept all major credit cards, PayPal, and Shopify Payments. Orders are processed upon payment confirmation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Free shipping on orders over $75. Enjoy 15% off your first order.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
